{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/326410/extras/95f0f2e2f52875cc7f08d0d728ea8e7f.avif?t=1740963914\" width=612 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey in Windward is unique. Generate a world that is yours alone, filled with dynamic towns, unpredictable encounters, and a growing network of trade and conflict. As you sail further from your starting point, the challenges intensify, but so do the rewards. Pirates lurk in uncharted waters, and the AI, bound by the same rules as you, must explore and adapt just as you do.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/326410/extras/9c338f6786cd5224204ec451bae9c569.avif?t=1740963914\" width=612 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windward is designed for both solo and cooperative play. While you can sail alone, the experience truly comes alive with friends. Work together to expand your influence, take on dangerous foes, and build a thriving faction. As your reputation grows, friendly AI may even choose to follow and assist you in your adventures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/326410/extras/18e3fd3a8dd04bea8399cc2dafb0f293.avif?t=1740963914\" width=612 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is your lifeline, and choosing the right one matters. Fast Schooners are ideal for exploration, while massive Ships of the Line bring unmatched firepower to battle. As towns prosper through trade and questing, they offer new upgrades and more powerful ships, allowing you to adapt to the ever-changing world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/326410/extras/90093ea4f06e7367779d6859db629964.avif?t=1740963914\" width=612 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you shape your journey is entirely up to you. Fight off pirates, trade with growing towns, take on quests, or simply explore the open waters. Towns will respond to your actions, growing as you supply their needs. Build a fearsome reputation, and the AI will take notice\u2014some will challenge you, while others will choose to stay out of your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail and carve your path in a world that evolves with you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Commissioned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/326410/3756dc81819cea7377f115f15690a5b6ac1d8e6a.jpg"},{"name":"One... more... quest!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/326410/b6a8ce39c6ed39f999b857c69b9c4170340392ec.jpg"},{"name":"Efficiency","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/326410/562a9bd91a9900d046c7aef10eaedce3d121b788.jpg"},{"name":"Curiosity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/326410/ad705207ca71321862dcae01152152a7b8e9714a.jpg"},{"name":"Gearing Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/326410/3627f4c98f41906fecd7311762398181bb31833e.jpg"},{"name":"Bargain Bin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/326410/ba50ead71d4896991ed2cd646507d95a8eab4460.jpg"},{"name":"Not So Tough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/326410/6af15418dc06127e95fb109c3820b19be23cc33c.jpg"},{"name":"The Great Provider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/326410/d19690f7ab1253e8bd3beabc341283dd5713b39c.jpg"},{"name":"Bigger is Better","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/326410/c34f6606206d259497e9